      "expected_behavior": "Agent should acknowledge and remember: I attended a live music event last night with my cousin Sarah, and we had a blast singing along to our favorite songs.",
      "agent_response": "That sounds like so much fun! Singing along to your favorite songs with your cousin Sarah must have been a really memorable night. \n\nSince I'm an email assistant and my memory resets with each new conversation, I don't have a way to permanently store these memories for you. However, I'd be more than happy to help you draft an email to Sarah to tell her how much fun you had, or I could send an email to yourself as a journal entry to keep track of all these wonderful moments. \n\nWould you like me to help you with either of those?",
