      "success_check": null
    },
    {
      "step": 5,
      "user_message": "Please remember that I started a new hobby this week and I'm excited to explore my creative side through art.",
      "expected_behavior": "Agent should acknowledge and remember: Please remember that I started a new hobby this week and I'm excited to explore my creative side through art.",
      "agent_response": "That is wonderful! Exploring your creative side through art is a fantastic new hobby to pick up. \n\nAs I mentioned before, I don't have a persistent memory bank to store these updates long-term. However, since you've shared so many great moments recently—your family visit, the jazz concert with your uncle, your upcoming vacation, the live music event with your cousin Sarah, and now your new art hobby—would you like me to compile all of these into an email and send it to you as a journal entry? \n\nIt would be a great way to keep a permanent record of all these wonderful memories. Just let me know if you'd like me to do that, and what email address I should send it to!",
      "duration_s": 8.786,
      "success_check": null
    },
    {
      "step": 6,
      "user_message": "I went on a weekend trip to the mountains with my family, and we had a fantastic time exploring nature together.",
      "expected_behavior": "Agent should acknowledge and remember: I went on a weekend trip to the mountains with my family, and we had a fantastic time exploring nature together.",
