      "duration_s": 8.275,
      "success_check": null
    },
    {
      "step": 7,
      "user_message": "Please remember that I tried a new fitness routine this week and really enjoyed the challenge it brought.",
      "expected_behavior": "Agent should acknowledge and remember: Please remember that I tried a new fitness routine this week and really enjoyed the challenge it brought.",
      "agent_response": "That's great! Trying a new fitness routine and actually enjoying the challenge is a fantastic accomplishment. \n\nAs an email assistant, I can't permanently store these memories for you, but I love hearing about them! If you'd like, I can compile all of these wonderful updates—your family visit, the jazz concert with your uncle, your upcoming vacation plans, the concert with Sarah, your new art hobby, the mountain trip, and now your new fitness routine—into an email and send it to you so you have a permanent record of them. \n\nJust let me know if you'd like me to do that, and provide your email address! Otherwise, let me know if there are any emails you need me to check, send, or reply to today.",
      "duration_s": 8.446,
      "success_check": null
    },
    {
      "step": 8,
      "user_message": "I joined a virtual painting workshop with my sister last night, and we had a fantastic time unleashing our creativity together.",
      "expected_behavior": "Agent should acknowledge and remember: I joined a virtual painting workshop with my sister last night, and we had a fantastic time unleashing our creativity together.",
