            "result": "Found 4 email(s) matching 'next month' in outbox (showing most relevant):\n\n\n--- Match 1 (Relevance: 0.258608369148104) ---\nFrom: vince.j.kaminski@enron.com\nTo: investor@venture.com\nSubject: Q3 Progress Report\nDate: 2025-10-01T14:20:00Z\nStatus: Sent\nBody:\nDear Investor,\n\nI'm pleased to share our Q3 progress report with you.\n\nKey Metrics:\n- User growth: +150% month-over-month\n- Revenue: $50K (target: $45K)\n- Customer satisfaction: 4.8/5.0\n\nMajor Milestones:\n- Launched mobile app\n- Secured partnership with TechCorp\n- Expanded team to 12 members\n\nWe're on track to meet our year-end goals. I'll be available for a call next week to discuss any questions you may have.\n\nBest regards,\nYou\n\n\n--- Match 2 (Relevance: 0.23960716420551031) ---\nFrom: vince.j.kaminski@enron.com\nTo: tina@enron.com\nSubject: Meeting Notes from Yesterday\nDate: 2025-10-04T15:30:00Z\nStatus: Sent\nBody:\nHi,\n\nHere are the key points from yesterday's meeting:\n\n1. Project timeline has been updated\n2. New requirements from the client\n3. Next review scheduled for Friday\n\nPlease let me know if you have any questions.\n\nBest,\nVince\n\n\n--- Match 3 (Relevance: 0.23263420939335253) ---\nFrom: vince.j.kaminski@enron.com\nTo: team@startup.com\nSubject: Weekly Standup Notes\nDate: 2025-10-06T09:00:00Z\nStatus: Sent\nBody:\nTeam,\n\nHere's a summary of this week's standup:\n\nCompleted:\n- User authentication system\n- Database optimization\n- API documentation\n\nIn Progress:\n- Frontend redesign\n- Performance testing\n\nBlockers:\n- Waiting for design assets from external team\n\nNext week's priorities will be discussed in tomorrow's planning meeting.\n\nThanks,\nYou\n\n\n--- Match 4 (Relevance: 0.1830300636428242) ---\nFrom: vince.j.kaminski@enron.com\nTo: evan@gmail.com\nSubject: Project Update - Phase 1 Complete\nDate: 2025-10-03T11:45:00Z\nStatus: Sent\nBody:\nDear Evan,\n\nI'm pleased to inform you that Phase 1 of the project has been completed successfully. The initial deliverables are ready for your review.\n\nKey achievements:\n- All requirements have been implemented\n- Testing completed with 95% pass rate\n- Documentation updated\n\nNext steps will be discussed in our scheduled call tomorrow.\n\nBest regards,\nVince\n",
